			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722120601,
					"content": "不过，奴家还是很好奇。石头那么硬的东西，怎么会变成奴家的样子呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722120602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722120602,
					"content": "那个石头人类，是不是很厉害？是不是会什么妖术？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722120603,
						722120605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722120603,
					"content": "很厉害的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722120604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722120604,
					"content": "原来如此，奴家很是期待哪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722120605,
					"content": "和做饭一样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722120606
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722120606,
					"content": "原来如此，奴家明白了。汝做的饭和阿响做的饭，都是好东西。所以，石头人类做的石头，也是好东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722120607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722120607,
					"content": "人类有时候真厉害哪。这次，也谢谢汝了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				}
			]
